{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52209","headline":"颂六十二首 三十四 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝刹承高露，绮彩映空天。\n宛转云间扬，倒下似红莲。\n霞旛开锦色，香气合炉烟。\n飘颻无定所。\n只爲本轻旋。\n池沼万影现，泉弄百华鲜。\n夙夜风吹动，重叠轮王因。\n攀仰无猒足，结侣感流瞻。\n何知色中彩，招福寿长年。\n（见同书同卷《悬旛篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}